ually beneficial alliance corliss  gets to protect his vital shipping lanes  and daemon can prove his worth to anyone  who may doubt it the episode ends with  this great juxtaposition of crab feeder  and daemon hinting at the clash of these  two princes to come now there's still a  lot to talk about in regards to this  episode and my plan is if hbo releases a  promo video for next episode for me to  do a breakdown of that where i'll  include the book spoilers you'll want to  be subscribed with the bell on to be  notified as soon as that drops thanks  for watching everyone be sure to like  and subscribe and for more bad takes you  can follow me on twitter and instagram  at thingstoryt until next time remember  it's a crispin wasn't it

